CORE no-new-smt
main.c

^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
^warning: ignoring
unexpected assignment to union member
--
Simplification turns the byte_extract expressions that represent the members of
a union into member expressions when the union is part of an element of an array
indexed by a non-constant index. Symbolic execution previously rejected such
assignments with "assign_rec: unexpected assignment to union member".
The incremental SMT back-end does not support arrays within unions.
